{"id":96894312443774,"name":"[EVENT X99] MOUNT DAY ONE","desc":"✨ Selamat datang di MOUNT DAY ONE ✨\nGame ini dibuat agar semua orang bisa menikmati, termasuk pemula yang baru main Roblox!\n\n🧗 Apa yang bisa kamu lakukan?\n\n1. Mendaki gunung dengan jalur mudah dipelajari\n\n2. Naik roller coaster seru 🎢 tanpa ribet\n\n3.Menjelajahi hutan, bukit, dan rahasia tersembunyi 🌲\n\n4. Raih puncak gunung bersama teman atau pasangan 🏆\n\n💡 Tips untuk Pemula:\n\n🔸Ikuti jalur jalan setapak untuk mulai mendaki.\n\n🔸Jangan takut jatuh, kamu bisa coba lagi kapan saja.\n\n🔸Cari papan petunjuk di jalur untuk menemukan jalan pintas.\n\n🔸Roller coaster ada di kaki gunung – gampang ditemukan!\n\n🔸Ajak temanmu biar lebih seru dan gampang sampai puncak.\n\n🌟 Mudah dimainkan, menyenangkan untuk semua!\nJadilah penakluk Mount Day One sekarang juga!","path":"/game/96894312443774-mount-day-one","slug":"96894312443774-mount-day-one","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/222b9ed63c1254486b0e460e9124fd6e29672a380e2d57d70e5ae362a5092fdf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0ab68bfe52622cf49ad0c4f9126f3026/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1275381,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-06T11:55:00.876Z","creator":{"name":"YouthDev","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"690c8c94a2cfae5e4d52b34f","title":"GATINERO HUB AUTO SUMMIT MOUNT GUNUNG","game":{"_id":"69064b07e24f2986f47ec5d5","gameId":96894312443774,"name":"[EVENT X99] MOUNT DAY ONE","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/07dcb99cb3a4be86246d5b0c43ad1e80144fbaa797f09254a894d268706e6a77.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-a1fc48c471398e9b4f7f7edd6b58dc46-0036cb70487b.png"},"slug":"96894312443774-mount-day-one","path":"/game/96894312443774-mount-day-one","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/07dcb99cb3a4be86246d5b0c43ad1e80144fbaa797f09254a894d268706e6a77.webp","original":"h